Ad Lib test songs for tests/m3/adlib_decode.sh (bbmp_adlib module, I710as). Never committed: each song is listed in
tests/m3/fixtures/bbmp_adlib.manifest as "<url> <sha256> <local name> <minimum seconds>" and fetched by sha256 into the
git-ignored tests/m3/fixtures/.cache. Source for all: the Modland scene archive, https://ftp.modland.com/pub/modules/Ad%20Lib/
(Johan 2026-11-08: unlicensed scene files are free to use as test fixtures; never committed, never bundled). Minimum seconds is
the measured length of the render, floored.

