Not in this module and so not in this manifest: EdLib Packed (.edl; AdPlug does not decode it, row I1204b) and Davey Taylor's FM Tracker
(also .fmt, magic "FMTracker\x01\x01", played by libopenmpt Load_fmt): bbmp_adlib must not claim it, adlib_decode.sh checks that. The bbmp_adlib
extension list is fmf,ftf,sig,lem,mus,cal,vib,fmt.
